The tensor-core GEMM design notes in crates/kernels/src/cu/mmq.cu reference
Marlin, as carried by vLLM:

  https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm  csrc/quantization/gptq_marlin/
  https://github.com/IST-DASLab/marlin
  "MARLIN: Mixed-Precision Auto-Regressive Parallel Inference on Large
   Language Models", Frantar, Castro, Chen, Hoefler, Alistarh, arXiv:2408.11743

Both are Apache License 2.0. The sources are vendored under vendor/marlin/ for
reference and are not compiled; see vendor/marlin/README.md for what reading
them established. Any code ported from them carries this notice.

